<!-- ══════════════════ SECTION 7 ══════════════════ -->
<h1>7. Production Launch Roadmap</h1>
<ol>
  <li><strong>Domain &amp; SSL:</strong> Bind custom domain in Railway and configure DNS CNAME/A records.</li>
  <li><strong>Email DNS:</strong> Verify SPF, DKIM, and DMARC records in Resend for official domain addresses.</li>
  <li><strong>Initial Super Admin:</strong> Execute <span class="highlight">/api/auth/setup-admin</span> one time to establish primary root access.</li>
  <li><strong>Export Enhancements:</strong> Add CSV and PDF export capabilities to the Trial Balance and Expense Tracker.</li>
  <li><strong>Social Logins:</strong> Register Google Cloud OAuth 2.0 Client credentials.</li>
</ol>

